<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 1008)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>A tier on personal links.</b> <i>Reviewer | Expert</i> beside <i>Add</i> under People sets what the link grants in Asobi Review; it is signed into the link.</li>
<li><b>The license letter's download link</b> is now <code>review.byautonomy.com/download/Asobi-Review-mac.zip</code> &#8212; one click, no Drive page.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
