</style>
<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 1006)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The Edit menu no longer repeats</b> Start Dictation and Emoji &amp; Symbols (macOS 26 added them once per shortcut and again on every menu rebuild).</li>
<li><b>Kitsu sign-in</b> can't be blocked by a leftover keychain item from a development build any more, and if the keychain does refuse, the message says why.</li>
<li><b>Manual updated</b>: inviting by personal link, <i>Licenses for Asobi Review</i> (requests, issuing, the letter, installing, extensions), and the web page's <i>Request the Mac app</i>.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
